n- Gyro aim pauses in the main menu and in the panels and maps you pick.\n- Reads shields, heat and weapon lists from the HUD.\n- Pages in Bururu: Effects (Haptics, Triggers, Lights) and Settings (HUD reader, In menus, Elite's files).\n- Hook points for add-ons: `weapon_layer@1`, `turn@1`, `heat@1`, `boost@1` and `state@1`.\n- Needs Bururu with mod API 0.10.","os":["windows","linux"],"permissions":{"files":{"bindings":{"label":"Bindings","path":"{LocalAppData}/Frontier Developments/Elite Dangerous/Options/Bindings","setting":"bindings_dir"},"journal":{"label":"Journal","path":"{SavedGames}/Frontier Developments/Elite Dangerous","proton":359320,"setting":"journal_dir"},"options":{"label":"Options","path":"{LocalAppData}/Frontier Developments/Elite Dangerous/Options","proton":359320}},"keyboard":true,"paths":[],"screen":true,"udp":[],"udp_forward":[]},"prerelease":false,"published":"2026-10-09T01:21:05Z","sha256":"bc133375cbede4602b3a3d3a9e9505abd1dbb53fd6c5662382ba3e471a54f218","size":159002,"url":"https://github.com/getbururu/mod-elite/releases/download/v0.1.0/elite-0.1.0.brr"}}}},"revoked":[],"serial":4}
